{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "a-note-from-hyacine",
  "name": "A Note from Hyacine",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/A_Note_from_Hyacine",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-11T05:51:38.089Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To my dearest Grayie,"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hand in hand, we shattered the firmament of the old gods,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "bringing clear skies and a long-overdue rainbow to the people of this world."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It was all because of you. You've always been the one to save us, our Deliverer."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You're incredible, Grayie! You deserve the most wonderful gift in the world!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I wish I could give you the light of dawn, but I fear it would be too faint to illuminate the deep, dark cosmos."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I wish I could give you the morning breeze, but it would lose its freedom the moment it is bottled up."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It was only when Little Ica rubbed up against me that I had an idea:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I'm going to give you this pendant I've always worn at my hip!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Little Ica might be as soft as a cotton ball, but this pendant... it's as sweet as cotton candy."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I hope just looking at it brings back all the sweet, warm memories we've made together..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "So please, wear it close to you."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "That way, you'll always feel the sky's warmth, and mine."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "So, I hope my gift will forever dance at your side, bringing a gentle breeze and the morning light,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "and may it guard the lovely memories of your journey, along with its healing chimes."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hyacinthia"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
